# Code release for *Deng et al. 2026*

This repository contains the public release of all analysis code used
in the *Deng et al. 2026, A scalable framework for automated
relabeling of mislabeled multi-omics samples*. It is organized into
separate subfolders for each of several analyses.

Note that the FOMO package itself is released in a separate
repository.

## Redactions

Please note that certain lines of code refer to internal details of
our computing environment and/or internal identifiers that cannot be
released publicly. These lines of code have been partially or
completely redacted in this public release. When practical, comments
has been added explaining the reason for the redaction and what the
redacted line of code would have done.

For similar reasons, we also cannot release the full git history of
this code.
